    {
      "comment_id": "Uggv9g8SmDB5ZngCoAEC",
      "text": "I absolutely love the Airpods. Best Bluetooth connection I've ever experienced. Over 100 feet easy depending on obstacles but they go through every wall/walls I've tried. I went all the way across the inside of a nearby department store with no hiccups. Fingers crossed but I have yet to experience latency at all when watching videos. My Jaybird Freedoms have latency issues all the time I have to disconnect/reconnect constantly. Most wireless buds have 1-2 hours of battery life which is ridiculous. Apple did a fantastic job with these and i tested charging for 15 minutes and my pods went from 10%-84%. I like the the design of the EarPods so I like these too. Easy and quick to take in and out of your ear. Easy to clean and no need to replace silicone/foam tips. IMO they knocked it out of the park. Some wireless buds cost over $300 with worse battery life so these are priced ok 👌 to me.",
